WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.210
Every form starts on your dashboard.

2
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:05.070
Click New form, and a blank page opens,

3
00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.290
so you can build it exactly the way you

4
00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.630
want. There is nothing to install,

5
00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:12.190
and the free plan has no limit on forms

6
00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:12.930
or responses.

7
00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:16.930
Give it a clear title.

8
00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:19.030
Customer feedback works well,

9
00:00:19.030 --> 00:00:20.790
because respondents see it first.

10
00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:22.970
You can change it at any time,

11
00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:24.270
and the link never changes.

12
00:00:25.683 --> 00:00:27.423
Press slash to add a block.

13
00:00:27.663 --> 00:00:30.003
Pick Short answer, and type your question,

14
00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.123
like what do you like most about our product.

15
00:00:32.943 --> 00:00:34.763
Respondents get a clean text box,

16
00:00:34.763 --> 00:00:37.543
and the answers land in your Tally dashboard as

17
00:00:37.543 --> 00:00:37.983
they arrive.

18
00:00:39.617 --> 00:00:40.537
Happy with it?

19
00:00:40.677 --> 00:00:41.317
Click Publish.

20
00:00:41.577 --> 00:00:43.397
Your form goes live right away,

21
00:00:43.397 --> 00:00:44.597
and you get a link to share.

22
00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:49.267
Copy the link and send it to your customers,

23
00:00:49.267 --> 00:00:51.107
or paste it into an email,

24
00:00:51.327 --> 00:00:53.067
a chat, or your help center.

25
00:00:53.647 --> 00:00:56.067
Every answer is collected for you automatically,

26
00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:58.787
so you can see what people think without chasing

27
00:00:58.787 --> 00:01:01.467
anyone. That is all it takes to launch a

28
00:01:01.467 --> 00:01:01.727
form.
